WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:05.266
The fish swam around and around.

2
00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:10.137
Mo got swept up in the current. "Help!"

3
00:00:10.138 --> 00:00:12.682
Cora grabbed him.

4
00:00:12.683 --> 00:00:16.282
The arrow suddenly pointed to something.

5
00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:20.677
The fish were swimming close together.

6
00:00:20.678 --> 00:00:24.829
They formed a huge shape.

7
00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:32.502
"Whoa!" Cora thought. "That's amazing."

8
00:00:32.503 --> 00:00:35.589
The shark stared at the fish.

9
00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:40.479
Its eyes went wide. "A monster!"

10
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.896
Then—

11
00:00:42.897 --> 00:00:48.743
whoosh! The shark swam away

12
00:00:48.744 --> 00:00:55.029
fast. Everybody cheered.

13
00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:58.659
"Woo-hoo!" "Thank you, fish," Mo

14
00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:02.615
said. "I'm glad our plan didn't

15
00:01:02.616 --> 00:01:06.728
work." "What plan?" a fish

16
00:01:06.729 --> 00:01:11.780
asked. "We wanted the shark to scare you away," Cora said.

17
00:01:11.781 --> 00:01:16.737
Mo smiled. "But you scared the shark instead!"

18
00:01:16.738 --> 00:01:22.248
The fish looked angry. "You tried to scare us?"

19
00:01:22.249 --> 00:01:26.394
"Er . . ." Cora looked away.

20
00:01:26.395 --> 00:01:28.737
So did Mo.

21
00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:31.616
"That's rude!" the fish said.

22
00:01:31.617 --> 00:01:36.573
"Yeah!" another said. "Really rude!"

23
00:01:36.574 --> 00:01:40.601
"We're not welcome here," one said.

24
00:01:40.602 --> 00:01:45.303
"Everybody, let's leave!"

25
00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:55.073
The fish swam away.

26
00:01:55.074 --> 00:01:59.279
Rainbow Reef was peaceful again.

27
00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:02.231
Rita stretched.

28
00:02:02.232 --> 00:02:09.706
Sasha came out from under her rock.

29
00:02:09.707 --> 00:02:17.726
Cora and Mo played sea glass checkers.

30
00:02:17.727 --> 00:02:22.961
Mo won again.

31
00:02:22.962 --> 00:02:27.727
But Cora smiled. "Good game, Mo.

32
00:02:27.728 --> 00:02:31.938
Sorry I was rude before!"

